<view class="studio-cover"
  ><image src="{{hero}}" mode="aspectFill" /><view class="cover-shade" /><view
    class="cover-top"
    >BRISBANE · DIGITAL &amp; FILM</view
  ><view class="cover-copy"
    ><view class="cover-brand">SepHannah</view
    ><view class="cover-subtitle">让这一刻，成为你的故事。</view
    ><button class="cover-link" bindtap="book">计划一次拍摄 ↗</button></view
  ></view
>
<view class="page"
  ><view class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT CHAPTER</view
  ><view class="title">为你而拍。</view
  ><view class="muted"
    >从毕业的欢呼，到牵手的承诺。先选喜欢的感觉，再一起确定拍摄的细节。</view
  >
  <view class="collection-grid"
    ><view
      class="collection-card"
      wx:for="{{collections}}"
      wx:key="slug"
      data-slug="{{item.slug}}"
      bindtap="gallery"
      ><image src="{{item.src}}" mode="aspectFill" lazy-load /><view
        class="collection-label"
        >{{item.zh}} ↗</view
      ><view class="muted">A${{item.price}} 起</view></view
    ></view
  >
  <view class="film-note"
    ><view class="eyebrow">SOME THINGS FEEL DIFFERENT ON FILM</view
    ><view class="heading"
      ><view>数码的细腻。</view><view>胶片的惊喜。</view></view
    ><view>加拍真实 35mm 胶片，A$100 / 卷，含冲洗。</view
    ><view class="muted space"
      >胶片感调色与真实胶片是不同选项。喜欢光线、颗粒与偶然，就把它一起放进你的拍摄计划。</view
    ></view
  >
  <view class="heading">预约，简单一点。</view
  ><view class="journey-step"
    ><text>01</text
    ><view
      >挑选风格<view class="muted">收藏喜欢的照片，让想法更具体。</view></view
    ></view
  ><view class="journey-step"
    ><text>02</text
    ><view
      >选套餐与日期<view class="muted"
        >查看公开时段，也可以写下偏好日期。</view
      ></view
    ></view
  ><view class="journey-step"
    ><text>03</text
    ><view
      >一起确认<view class="muted"
        >Hannah 确认方案、档期和定金后完成预约。</view
      ></view
    ></view
  >
  <button class="button" bindtap="book">查看套餐与档期 ↗</button
  ><view class="row"
    ><text class="small-link" bindtap="guide">拍摄须知 / 常见问题</text
    ><text class="small-link" bindtap="contact">复制 Hannah 微信</text></view
  ><view class="muted"
    >常驻 Brisbane。覆盖机票与住宿，也可以出发去你所在的城市。</view
  ></view
>
